.TH NOBARA-KERNEL-MANAGER 1 "August 2026" "Nobara Kernel Manager 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
nobara-kernel-manager \- manage Nobara Mainline, LTS, and rescue kernels
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nobara-kernel-manager
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Nobara Kernel Manager
is a graphical utility for switching between the Nobara Mainline and LTS
kernel families and rebuilding the rescue kernel.
.PP
Kernel-changing operations require administrator authentication. The kernel
switch buttons are unavailable when a third-party kernel is present in GRUB.
The rescue-kernel action remains available.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/nobara-kernel-manager/kernel-manager
Privileged kernel-management backend.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/nobara-kernel-manager/kernel-status
Read-only GRUB entry inspection helper.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dnf (8),
.BR dracut (8),
.BR grubby (8)
